WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
Gemini’s $46 skincare routine
adds up to $52.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.640
It lists four prices:

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.060
$17, $6, $14, and $15.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.260
That’s $52, not $46—

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.660
and above the shopper’s $50 limit.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.360
Claude opens with “well under $50,”

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.660
but later gives a $47–$52 range.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.660
ChatGPT’s listed basket totals $37.97.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.360
Perplexity’s totals $38.98.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:30.120
We checked the arithmetic
of captured quotes.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.300
We did not verify checkout prices.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.000
This November 24 skincare snapshot

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
contains 12 usable answers

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.980
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.980
For your brand, appearing
in a budget recommendation

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:44.980
doesn’t establish budget eligibility.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.540
Check the basket, not just the mention.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:51.500
These findings describe captured answers,
not product quality.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.600
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
